      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Garza and the nursing team for their warmth, dedication, and patient demeanor during exams. Many clients note they have trusted the practice for over a decade, highlighting attentive care during difficult diagnoses and emergency c-sections."
      }
    },
