      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle hands for nervous puppies and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how gently the clinic treats anxious or frightened pets during shots and clinical procedures. Nurses take extra care with frightened puppies and soothe resisting dogs, ensuring animals receive treatments and flea medications with minimal stress or discomfort."
      }
    },
