        "en": "Extended lobby waits on busy walk-in mornings"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate walk-in accessibility but note that the clinic experiences lengthy wait times, especially on crowded Saturday mornings. Several pet parents advise arriving early and managing the sign-in sheet carefully, though most agree the thorough care is well worth the delay."
      }
    }
